## Test file

`packages/architecture-enforcement/src/__tests__/architecture-v2-route-14d.test.ts`
(12 cases). Test hunks only; no production hunk was copied. The file
ports the 41e320d9d delta cases in their c6e3e4462 final form, with one
adaptation: the review subject is recomputed with a local helper because
`computeV2ManifestReviewSubjectSha256` is not exported on master.

Two r4 corrections were made to the staged file. First, a comment that
held a `measure/runs/` path and unlabeled counts was reworded, so the
file holds no A9 path and no bare count. Second, the preview case stubs
only the async manifest validator. The task 1.4 pin is stale against the
current tree, so that validator otherwise reports "Analyzer input
snapshot hash does not match current bytes" before the four-file staging
runs. The pin contract is covered by `architecture-ci-input-pin.test.ts`.
The sync validator used by the delta cases stays real. A getter over the
real module keeps the overlay case failing on a missing function, and
lets the ported Green export show without a further edit to the mock.

All imports resolve at HEAD. The vitest format follows the package
convention; the shell-harness note does not apply to this package.

Anti-pattern detectors over the test file exit 1 (no hits):
`rg -n 'measure/tracks|measure/runs' <file>` (A9), the A3 bare-digit
count detector, and the A7 bare-English filter detector.

